  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g4_giantwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "9:27 A.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，高牆之上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三零九號出入口發生騷亂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......報告將軍，巡邏隊發現反抗軍蹤跡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不止反抗軍！巡邏隊正與多方同時交火——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，是否派人支援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進度如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概還要一刻鐘左右才能調試好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "八分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在八分鐘之內準備好。情況不容許我們拖太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用我下去看看？當然，只是一個建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你擔心我會失敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會呢？你的計算從未失準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我的工作，是確保我們通往勝利的道路上少一些變數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼你已經做得足夠好了，雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧，站到這邊來。在試驗正式開始之前，我需要讓你也看看這高牆下的局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與卡茲戴爾的戰場相比，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不算新鮮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......至少交手雙方並不都是薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在卡茲戴爾的時候，應該也獵過獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "獵獸？對常年身處野外的雇傭兵來說，這也算是填飽肚子的必要選項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你一定知道，為何我要留下這些出入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有的時候，陷阱雖然顯眼，但因為處在必經之路上，野獸們還是會一個接著一個地踩上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是找不到出路，它們反而會到處亂竄，讓我們不得不分散人力去圍追堵截。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這是荒地裡的法則，但不止如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看我們腳下的這座城市。它大到就像鋼鐵叢生的荒野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰有自信能封住一片荒野上的全部出路？誰又能找出叢林中每一處視野邊緣的縫隙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會這般自負。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你選擇留下幾個缺口，集中注意，等著敵人自己冒出來。這是效率最高的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可也有一定風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不冒險的話，怎麼會有收獲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "換作是我，我也會這麼選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。出色的雇傭兵頭領，也一定是優秀的獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起那些王庭遺老，我更喜歡和你一起並肩作戰，而這就是原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看起來，你今天收獲頗豐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了反抗軍，還有深池......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，我見過那個術師，她來見過你。你們不是達成停戰約定了嗎？雖然可能你們都沒太把這當回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你見過她，你就該知道，那樣的人，從來不清楚自己該在何時停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早就想排除掉這個攪局者了，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事態在變化。殿下的工程接近尾聲，場面太亂的話，容易漏掉一些真正的威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要把精力更多地放在外面那些大公爵身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你不如直接派我下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是除掉她的話，用不著你動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有其他顧慮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那位“威靈頓的鐵衛”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他尚未帶人靠近倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而只要他一天不表態，倫蒂尼姆外的那些貴族，每天早上第一件事，就一定是詢問自己的密使，鐵公爵有沒有發言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我們還不能與深池明面交惡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，要是她耐不住了，主動做什麼撕毀約定的事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲也絕沒有繼續容忍他們的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那下面發生的衝突確實還不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我們還需要一些......真正能把深池解決掉的把柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g2_inexport"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這些突然冒出來的是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道......長官，他們的武器和源石技藝我們都沒見過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們也在和薩卡茲交戰......不是魔族佬的援軍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管了，誰礙事我們就除掉誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乖乖把人還回來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唷，熟人？看來你早上挨的揍還不夠狠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意後面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰場上的敵人不會站在你面前任由你揮拳頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是還有你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克制一些。比起把敵人揍得鼻青臉腫，我們更優先的任務是救人，然後撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就拳頭揮得更快一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說......他們就是剛剛從我們手裡搶人的那夥人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記住他們的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，等等......看看能不能抓一個活的回去。不管倫蒂尼姆裡混進來了什麼新的勢力，領袖都會感興趣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......怎麼突然有石頭冒出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心一些，我們還沒踏入高牆，博士不想看見有人受傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的......你們也是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一錘子把我的造物砸碎了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這傢伙......和維多利亞士兵一樣可惡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我也沒使什麼力......嘗嘗這個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推進之王，閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有人替我打掉了威脅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白輪，你看到是誰了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，太亂了，我看不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，戰場上還有別的人在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了我們、深池還有薩卡茲以外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，他們看起來並不是敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，戰況對我們不太有利......您能不能讓這面牆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這面牆......呵......我倒是幻想過很多次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，真到了那一天，領袖來了，我們不是沒有機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在還不是說這些話的時候，我們必須再忍耐一段時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們也聽著些，動起手來收斂些，不要留什麼破綻，我不想讓那個叫曼弗雷德的魔族佬提前來找我們麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g4_giantwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "四分鐘。我們還要再等四分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，我們的戰士也還沒盡興。要守住一座像倫蒂尼姆這樣的城市，和在荒郊野嶺打劫拉特蘭商隊相比，算得上天差地別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "熟人相會，還不用擔心對方是不是隨時惦記著自己的腦袋，我可沒資格抱怨這生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別把你自己和他們混為一談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒幾個雇傭兵會和你一樣，能忍受那種被關在小院子裡天天看書的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你把我撈出來，並且把劍還給我的時候，我是說了謝謝的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，我讓你幫我，不是為了聽你說這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要雇傭兵，而且不是借一兩次力量那種需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......而你是其中最出色的那一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，最近又有幾支雇傭兵軍團加入了我們，裡面有幾位還是你在疤痕商場的老熟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攝政王開的價碼，很少有雇傭兵能夠拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們所圖的已不僅僅是完成一兩個合約之後能換取的一點獎賞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們跟隨著攝政王離開卡茲戴爾的時候，每一位戰士所持的武器都不一樣，有的人穿著的盔甲上一秒還穿在敵人身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而現在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也看見了，倫蒂尼姆的工廠日夜不停地在為我們生產防具與武器。我們的部隊有了新的規制，接受統一的號令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們正前所未有地團結，而這份團結使我們比以往更強大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，整個維多利亞......不，整個泰拉都看在眼裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這都在攝政王的計算之內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在一年之前，他們還可笑地以為倫蒂尼姆的軍隊是如何堅不可摧，他們以為我們只是服務於某一位公爵的雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當雇傭兵信奉的不再只有利益......他們都會看見我們薩卡茲能做到什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不再效忠於利益的雇傭兵，還是雇傭兵嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們並未要求這些同胞徹底拋下雇傭兵的身份，是他們找到了追隨攝政王的其他理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們相信攝政王正在改變薩卡茲的生活，除了居無定所的劫掠者與為他族權勢者服務的工具之外，薩卡茲有機會為自己贏來新的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只有有家的人，才有身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“當薩卡茲渴望戰爭時，薩卡茲即戰爭本身——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“——而在每一場戰爭結束後，薩卡茲亦有家可歸。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是攝政王對所有在倫蒂尼姆的薩卡茲說的話，當時你也在覲見之列。那是我們第一次會面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一天，我就問過你對這句話的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“只要是從卡茲戴爾的廢墟中爬出來的戰士，誰能拒絕這樣的願景？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我上次聽見這個回答，還是三年前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今你已經從那座宅邸裡走了出來，站到了我的身側。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的想法......依舊不變？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德，你已經得到了我的效忠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的左眼，還疼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年過去，早就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......希望你明白。自從那一天起，我就從未懷疑我們之間的友誼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你知道我指的是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赦罪師們不會放下對任何一名雇傭兵的戒心。這是他們為攝政王效力的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我......我的工作不會是為了向某些人證明自己的忠心，這只會成為我在戰場上拔劍的阻礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你的答案依舊是“不”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這也不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時候我也更需要一位朋友，為此，卡茲戴爾可以忍受暫時少一位校官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，準備好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳令巡邏隊，立刻撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啟動自動瞄準系統，輸入遠程打擊目標——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——座標，薩迪恩區，三零九號出入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們過去幾個月的努力終於要見到結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷，你想按下啟動鍵嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g15_customs"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中尉，深池看起來快要贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不是深池要贏了，但這不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別管他們誰輸誰贏，重要的是他們彼此牽制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是我們需要的局面，一個能讓你們衝到前面去的局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "衝到前面去......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，趁他們沒辦法把注意力放在我們身上。這是你們逃出城的好時機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，羅本？你在想什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中尉，我不想走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可能是你們撤離倫蒂尼姆的唯一機會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天發生了這場混戰，明天這扇門就會被薩卡茲堵上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把你們的武器藏起來，混在前面那些奔逃躲避的平民裡！走，往前走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們不該就這樣逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中尉，我們還可以戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看見了嗎？我剛才射倒了一個深池士兵！我還傷到了兩個薩卡茲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把弩......很粗糙，與我們慣常使用的制式軍弩完全不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是您做的，是嗎？您連武器都需要親手來做，難道不需要更多一起奮戰的戰友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我需不需要的問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不願意這就走，我也不會強迫你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不想再下令讓一個不願意離開的士兵離開戰場了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中尉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先不說這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們必須馬上離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最好的時機只有此刻，你們不想往前走，那好，我們一起後撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g2_inexport"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，薩卡茲士兵們在離開戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來就有些奇怪，他們竟然跟我們還有深池混戰了這麼久，卻既沒有派來援軍，也沒有對深池趕盡殺絕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不像我熟悉的薩卡茲戰士的作戰風格，就連W帶去整合運動的雇傭兵都比他們打得用心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "很不對勁。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我們是不是掉進陷阱了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場衝突，來得又巧合又突然......就好像，有人想把我們都聚在一起，然後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，這陷阱真的是為我們準備的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推進之王小姐說，她在戰場上發現了其他人，他們也和我們一樣，混在人堆裡......而且看起來也站在平民一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們會不會才是薩卡茲士兵在抓捕的對象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "作戰幹員馬上撤出交戰區。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "偵察小組，掩護作戰幹員和平民撤退。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "所有人，就近找掩體準備撤離！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士下令撤退了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？我們馬上就能把人都救完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士一定有自己的判斷。我們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，因陀羅女士！我、我在這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "托馬斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火光在一瞬間填滿了每個人的視野。\n滾燙的熱流幾乎熔化了所有能觸及到的物體。\n沒有太多完整的碎片飛出來，但劇烈的震動提醒著倖存者們，自己剛才距離死亡只有一步之遙。\n而這威脅正來自頭頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人從空中丟炸彈下來？這地面上......突然就......炸開了這麼大的坑？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "托馬斯......咳咳，煙這麼大，什麼都看不見啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因陀羅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聽見了，推進之王讓你停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，你又救了我一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道就行了，趕緊走——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
